+# CSL Assets License
+
+The citation style (`.csl`) files and locale file (`locales-en-US.xml`) in this
+directory are sourced from the [Citation Style Language](https://github.com/citation-style-language)
+project's [styles](https://github.com/citation-style-language/styles) and
+[locales](https://github.com/citation-style-language/locales) repositories, and are
+distributed under the [Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported
+License](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/) (CC-BY-SA-3.0). The
+`vancouver.csl` file is a copy of that project's `nlm-citation-sequence.csl`
+independent style (the "NLM/Vancouver: Citing Medicine 2nd edition" style),
+used here under the same license since the repository no longer ships a
+standalone `vancouver.csl`.
